{
  "_comment": [
    "Source paths for setup/stage_models.py, as used on the machine where this",
    "research ran. Paths are absolute because the artefacts were produced over",
    "several months across directories outside the repository. Anyone",
    "reproducing this work should edit this file, not the script.",
    "",
    "'dest' is the path inside the Hugging Face repository.",
    "'keep_parent' preserves one directory level, which matters for the",
    "segmented Edge TPU models: each model's segments live in their own",
    "directory and would otherwise collide by filename."
